[size=3]Modules[/size]
[table]
[tr][th]Module[/th][th]Adds[/th][th]Needs[/th][/tr]
[tr][td]Integration Hub[/td][td]Shared services, settings, temperament[/td][td]Mantella (always installed)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]OStim Expansion[/td][td]Scene flows, scene talk, bystanders, favourite positions[/td][td]OStim Standalone[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Arousal[/td][td]Arousal, appetite, satisfied and overwhelmed[/td][td]OSL Aroused[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Relationships[/td][td]Marriage, romance bond, shared history[/td][td]MARAS, Romantasy or Lover's Ledger[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[size=3]What the hub does[/size]
[table]
[tr][th]Feature[/th][th]Effect[/th][/tr]
[tr][td]Quiet outfits[/td][td]No equip / unequip spam in conversations during scenes and after loading screens[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Event sender[/td][td]Modules add in-game lines and let NPCs speak on their own, with cooldowns[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Temperament[/td][td]Reserved, bold or forward per NPC; set with a hotkey[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Settings[/td][td]One menu for the hub and every module[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[size=3]Requirements[/size]
[table]
[tr][th]Mod[/th][th]Needed[/th][/tr]
[tr][td][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98631]Mantella[/url][/td][td]Yes[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]SKSE, PapyrusUtil, MCM Helper[/td][td]Yes[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[size=3]Installation[/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install with your mod manager.
[*]Tick the modules you want in the installer.
[*]Load the plugins anywhere after Mantella.
[/list]

[size=3]Notes[/size]
[list]
[*]Modules need only the hub, never each other.
[*]Uninstalling a module just removes its feature.
[/list]
